{
  "id": "DEU.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Obwijukiro 24",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'omushaija yakutahya omukazi akamushwera, ahanyuma omukazi ogwo akamutama aha rw'emize, yakuhandika ebarua y'okumutambya mara amubinga omwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi k'aligenda akashwerwa omushaija ondijo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mushaijawe owa nyuma akamutamwa akamuhandikira ebarua y'obutaane akagimuha akamubinga omwe, anga mushaijawe owa nyuma kayakufa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho mushaijawe owa mbere tiyakumugarura k'aba mukaziwe rundi orwo yahagaire. Omukazi ogwo yabaire muziro aha Mukama; otalileta ntambara omu nsi ey'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaha obusika.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orwo omushaija ashweire juba atalitabara na ihe anga kukwasibwa mwoga gwona. Aikare omuka omwaka gwona aikaze mukaziwe owo ashweire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu atalikwatilizibwa mukwato gwa rubengo anga nseiso; aha rw'okuba yakuba nakwatilizibwa oburora bw'omuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'omuntu yakukwatwa naiba Omwisiraeli omurumuna, kimukwata akamuhindura mwiru anga akamuguza, kimukwata ogwo afe. Nikwo mulichwa mutyo omuze ogwo omuli inywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Olimanya k'olikwatwa ebibembe, oyegendeleze kukora byona nk'okwo abakuhani Abalevita balikuragilira. Okwo nabaragire oyekomye kuba nikwo okora otyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijuka eky'Omukama Ruhanga wawe yakozire Miriamu omu muhanda orwo mwabaire nimuruga Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'olihora mutahi wawe eibanja ly'engeli yona yona, otaligya mwe kwehigira mukwato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyemelere aheru wenene abe niwe agukushoholeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi k'aliba ali munaku otalirara mu mukwatogwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo eizoba lilitobera omugarulire omukwato abone kurara omu beboye mara akuhe omugisha. Aho oliba okoleire kurungi Omukama Ruhanga wawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Otaligingiza mwiru omukozi w'emilimo, omunaku mara omworo. Alikaba Mwisiraeli murumuna wawe anga muntu afurukiire mu nsi yanyu omu bigo byanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhe emperwaye aha kir'ekyo yagikolera eizoba litakatobeire; enshonga munaku mara n'omutimagwe niho agutaire; atalikutegelera aha Mukama okakwatwa omushango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baishebantu batalitwa nibaturwa bana. N'abana batalitwa nibaturwa baishebo. Buli muntu aitwe naturwa bufubwe nyabwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Otaligobeza mufuruki anga nfuuzi, anga omwendo gw'entumbwakazi kugutwara mukwato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oijuke okwo wabaire oli mwiru omuli Misiri n'okwo Omukama Ruhanga wawe yakuchungwireyo. Aha rw'ekyo ninkuragira ntyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'oliba nogesha omusiri gwawe okebwayo omuganda, otaligarukayo kuguhiga. Guliba gw'omufuruki, enfuuzi n'entumbwa, nirwo Omukama Ruhanga wawe aliha omugisha emilimo yawe yona ey'olikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'olinoga ezeituni zawe, amatagi otaligashubaho. Eziliba zisigairemu ziliba z'omufuruki, enfuuzi n'entumbwakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'olinoga ezabibu omu ndimiro yawe y'emizabibu, otalishubamu kunoga za kabili. Ezo ziliba z'omufuruki, enfuuzi n'entumbwakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olijuka okwo wabaire oli mufuruki omu nsi ya Misiri. Aha rw'ekyo ninkuragira ntyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
